# cards/sets/ is a local staging area for sets being worked on. A set becomes
# official when `npm run create:sets` promotes it into public/sets/, which is
# the tracked source of truth for both the card images and the card data.
# `**` also covers subfolders inside a set (e.g. cards/sets/PRS-02/Main/).
/cards/sets/**/*.png
/cards/sets/**/*.json
!/cards/sets/*/cover.png
